ng priorities and tracking tasks","Avoiding updates","Doing everything at the last minute"],"answer":"Setting priorities and tracking tasks"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-common-l4-quiz-q2","type":"tf","q":"A task list should be reviewed and updated as work progresses.","answer":true},{"id":"virtual-assistant-common-l4-quiz-q3","type":"id","q":"Arranging tasks from most to least important is called ______.","answer":"prioritizing"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-common-l4-quiz-q4","type":"mcq","q":"A teammate is behind on a shared task. What is the best action?","options":["Ignore it","Offer help and inform the lead","Complain about it later","Take over without telling anyone"],"answer":"Offer help and inform the lead"}]},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l1-quiz","programId":"virtual-assistant","lessonId":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l1","title":"The Virtual Assistant Profession Quiz","passing":75,"timeLimit":15,"published":true,"questions":[{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l1-quiz-q1","type":"mcq","q":"A VA niche is:","options":["A specialized service area such as admin or social media","A type of laptop","A time zone","A payment method"],"answer":"A specialized service area such as admin or social media"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l1-quiz-q2","type":"tf","q":"Virtual assistants usually work remotely for clients in different locations.","answer":true},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l1-quiz-q3","type":"id","q":"A self-employed professional serving several clients is a ______.","answer":"freelancer"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l1-quiz-q4","type":"mcq","q":"Which builds long-term client relationships?","options":["Missing deadlines","Clear communication and reliability","Overpromising","Ignoring feedback"],"answer":"Clear communication and reliability"}]},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l2-quiz","programId":"virtual-assistant","lessonId":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l2","title":"Remote Work Setup & Productivity Quiz","passing":75,"timeLimit":15,"published":true,"questions":[{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l2-quiz-q1","type":"mcq","q":"Why is a backup power source important for remote work?","options":["To decorate the desk","To avoid downtime during outages","To increase internet speed","To store files"],"answer":"To avoid downtime during outages"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l2-quiz-q2","type":"tf","q":"Time-zone differences should be considered when scheduling client meetings.","answer":true},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l2-quiz-q3","type":"id","q":"A dedicated space for working at home is a home ______.","answer":"office"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u1-l2-quiz-q4","type":"mcq","q":"Which habit improves remote productivity?","options":["Working twelve hours without breaks","Planning the day and blocking focus time","Keeping notifications on all night","Skipping task lists"],"answer":"Planning the day and blocking focus time"}]},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l1-quiz","programId":"virtual-assistant","lessonId":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l1","title":"Email & Calendar Management Quiz","passing":75,"timeLimit":15,"published":true,"questions":[{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l1-quiz-q1","type":"mcq","q":"Inbox zero means:","options":["Deleting all email","Every message is processed or filed","Never checking email","Reading email once a week"],"answer":"Every message is processed or filed"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l1-quiz-q2","type":"tf","q":"Canned responses help answer recurring emails consistently.","answer":true},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l1-quiz-q3","type":"id","q":"Automatically sorting incoming messages into folders uses email ______.","answer":"filters"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l1-quiz-q4","type":"mcq","q":"What should you check before scheduling a meeting?","options":["The client's availability and time zone","The largest free slot","Nothing at all","Only your own calendar"],"answer":"The client's availability and time zone"}]},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l2-quiz","programId":"virtual-assistant","lessonId":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l2","title":"Document & Data Management Quiz","passing":75,"timeLimit":15,"published":true,"questions":[{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l2-quiz-q1","type":"mcq","q":"Which tool is best for creating a budget spreadsheet?","options":["Google Sheets","Google Docs","Canva","Slack"],"answer":"Google Sheets"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l2-quiz-q2","type":"tf","q":"Cloud folders should follow a consistent naming convention.","answer":true},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l2-quiz-q3","type":"id","q":"Saving files online so they are reachable anywhere is called ______ storage.","answer":"cloud"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u2-l2-quiz-q4","type":"mcq","q":"Why should access permissions be set on shared folders?","options":["To protect confidential files","To slow downloads","To use more storage","To change file colors"],"answer":"To protect confidential files"}]},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l1-quiz","programId":"virtual-assistant","lessonId":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l1","title":"Professional Client Communication Quiz","passing":75,"timeLimit":15,"published":true,"questions":[{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l1-quiz-q1","type":"mcq","q":"Which subject line is most professional?","options":["hey","Meeting request: Project Kickoff - Oct 24","URGENT!!!","(no subject)"],"answer":"Meeting request: Project Kickoff - Oct 24"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l1-quiz-q2","type":"tf","q":"A video call should start by checking audio and camera settings.","answer":true},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l1-quiz-q3","type":"id","q":"Written workplace messages should keep a professional ______.","answer":"tone"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l1-quiz-q4","type":"mcq","q":"A client asks for a change you cannot deliver today. What is the best reply?","options":["Ignore the message","Acknowledge it and give a realistic timeline","Say yes and delay silently","Blame the team"],"answer":"Acknowledge it and give a realistic timeline"}]},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l2-quiz","programId":"virtual-assistant","lessonId":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l2","title":"Customer Support Basics Quiz","passing":75,"timeLimit":15,"published":true,"questions":[{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l2-quiz-q1","type":"mcq","q":"A ticketing system is used to:","options":["Track and resolve customer requests","Send marketing email","Design logos","Host video calls"],"answer":"Track and resolve customer requests"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l2-quiz-q2","type":"tf","q":"Issues that cannot be resolved should be escalated with complete details.","answer":true},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l2-quiz-q3","type":"id","q":"The measure of how happy customers are is customer ______.","answer":"satisfaction"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u3-l2-quiz-q4","type":"mcq","q":"What makes a support reply effective?","options":["Long paragraphs of jargon","Clear, empathetic and specific answers","Copy-paste without reading","Delaying until the customer gives up"],"answer":"Clear, empathetic and specific answers"}]},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l1-quiz","programId":"virtual-assistant","lessonId":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l1","title":"Social Media Management Quiz","passing":75,"timeLimit":15,"published":true,"questions":[{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l1-quiz-q1","type":"mcq","q":"A content calendar helps to:","options":["Plan and schedule posts in advance","Increase internet speed","Store passwords","Replace analytics"],"answer":"Plan and schedule posts in advance"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l1-quiz-q2","type":"tf","q":"Analytics show which posts perform best.","answer":true},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l1-quiz-q3","type":"id","q":"Tools that publish posts at set times are called ______ tools.","answer":"scheduling"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l1-quiz-q4","type":"mcq","q":"Before posting on a client account you should:","options":["Follow the approved content plan","Post whatever you like","Share the password publicly","Ignore brand guidelines"],"answer":"Follow the approved content plan"}]},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l2-quiz","programId":"virtual-assistant","lessonId":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l2","title":"Typing Proficiency & Data Entry Quiz","passing":75,"timeLimit":15,"published":true,"questions":[{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l2-quiz-q1","type":"mcq","q":"Touch typing means typing:","options":["With two fingers","Without looking at the keyboard","With the right hand only","Using voice input"],"answer":"Without looking at the keyboard"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l2-quiz-q2","type":"tf","q":"Accuracy matters more than speed when entering client data.","answer":true},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l2-quiz-q3","type":"id","q":"Typing speed is measured in words per ______.","answer":"minute"},{"id":"virtual-assistant-core-u4-l2-quiz-q4","type":"mcq","q":"Which practice reduces data entry errors?","options":["Double-checking entries against the source","Typing as fast as possible","Skipping verification","Copy-pasting everything"],"answer":"Double-checking entries against the source"}]}]$q$::jsonb)
  where id = 'virtual-assistant';

