on for the period","Recording a cash sale","Paying a supplier","Opening a bank account"],"answer":"Recording depreciation for the period"},{"id":"bookkeeping-exam-1-q10","type":"tf","q":"The statement of financial position reports assets, liabilities and equity at a point in time.","answer":true}],"questionCount":10,"timeLimit":60,"passing":75,"date":"2026-12-10","status":"Upcoming","published":true}]$q$::jsonb)
